    "nextEpisodeBlockRule": "a work is blocked while an active (non-ARCHIVED) episode has a current BEFORE_CONFIRMATION report whose reviewStage is not APPLIED (INVALIDATED included) and whose whole-episode application receipt is not APPLIED; a report with an APPLIED receipt never blocks even after a later invalidation; DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY reports, retired (current=false) reports and reports of deleted episodes are not consulted",
